// `std.buffer`: the home of the native buffer atoms. `Buf` is the opaque
// buffer a receive places live and a send returns, and `Web` is the
// decomposition a dialogue's log answers. A source names each by listing it,
// `import std.buffer (Buf, Web);`. Both atoms are native, so no declaration
// here states them. The lowering answers each in a source that lists it from
// this module, and nowhere else.
//
// - see: #4522
